  (text "(DSP: 5 Hz DC blocker)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 45.72 106.68 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "5af1f6fc-a301-593b-bf67-8927a9a755b4"))
  (text "Section 2 of the circuit notes. The output feeds both the clean path and the driven path.\nRX3: the documented 1 MOhm input impedance [1], as a bias resistor to VB (position inferred).\nCX2: input coupling, chosen with RX3 for the DSP's 5 Hz DC blocker (fi.dcblockerat(5)).\nUX1: a unity-gain buffer. The pedal has RC4558 op-amps [5]; that one buffers the input is inferred." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 198.12 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "91ae8899-95e2-535d-862b-3e23a027f3b9"))
